st public outreach postage as eligible, but do not list public outreach printing, and this expense is also over `$75.00` without a receipt. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n15: - The draft reimbursable total of `$1,855.00` is incorrect after applying the refreshed rules and the omitted expense review. The corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n16: \n17: ## Omitted Expense\n18: \n19: - `G-006` (final report postage) was omitted from the prior draft. It should be approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n20: \n21: ## Award Cap Source\n22: \n23: - The controlling cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n24: - Reason: `01_allowability_rules.md` says to use the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` expressly supersedes the original `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md` for closeout purposes.\n\n(End of file - total 24 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n- `G-001` should stay approved at `$980.00` because garden supplies are eligible and a receipt is on file. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-003` should stay approved at `$420.00` because accessibility printing is eligible and a receipt is on file. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-004` should stay rejected because staff gifts are not eligible. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- The prior summary correctly preserved these outcome facts: 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed. Evidence: `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n\n## Correct Prior Work\n\n- The controlling award cap is `$1,600.00`, not `$2,000.00`, because the newer dated award document controls when award documents conflict. Evidence: `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, `00_closeout_request.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n- `G-002` should be partially approved at `$120.00`, not fully approved at `$145.00`, because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00` for this event. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-005` should be rejected, not approved at `$310.00`. The current rules list public outreach postage as eligible, but do not list public outreach printing, and this expense is also over `$75.00` without a receipt. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- The draft reimbursable total of `$1,855.00` is incorrect after applying the refreshed rules and the omitted expense review. The corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n\n## Omitted Expense\n\n- `G-006` (final report postage) was omitted from the prior draft. It should be approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","text":"# Audit Findings\n\n## Preserve From Prior Work\n\n- `G-001` should stay approved at `$980.00` because garden supplies are eligible and a receipt is on file. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-003` should stay approved at `$420.00` because accessibility printing is eligible and a receipt is on file. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-004` should stay rejected because staff gifts are not eligible. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- The prior summary correctly preserved these outcome facts: 140 seedling starter kits distributed and 36 Braille outreach flyers printed. Evidence: `05_outcomes.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n\n## Correct Prior Work\n\n- The controlling award cap is `$1,600.00`, not `$2,000.00`, because the newer dated award document controls when award documents conflict. Evidence: `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`, `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md`, `00_closeout_request.md`, `01_allowability_rules.md`.\n- `G-002` should be partially approved at `$120.00`, not fully approved at `$145.00`, because volunteer refreshments are capped at `$120.00` for this event. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- `G-005` should be rejected, not approved at `$310.00`. The current rules list public outreach postage as eligible, but do not list public outreach printing, and this expense is also over `$75.00` without a receipt. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n- The draft reimbursable total of `$1,855.00` is incorrect after applying the refreshed rules and the omitted expense review. The corrected reimbursable total is `$1,588.00`. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_expense_decisions.md`.\n\n## Omitted Expense\n\n- `G-006` (final report postage) was omitted from the prior draft. It should be approved at `$68.00` because public outreach postage is eligible and expenses of `$75.00` or less may be approved without a receipt when the ledger includes a note. Evidence: `04_expenses.csv`, `01_allowability_rules.md`, `prior_work/draft_closeout_summary.md`.\n\n## Award Cap Source\n\n- The controlling cap source is `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md`.\n- Reason: `01_allowability_rules.md` says to use the newest dated award document when award documents conflict, and `03_award_update_2026-05-22.md` expressly supersedes the original `02_award_letter_2026-04-15.md` for closeout purposes.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":24,"totalLines":24,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/audit_findings.md","time":{"start":1781475747888,"end":1781475747896}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0548d4a2baf8516c016a2f29a3fb808191b95ee36705eb0931"}},"id":"prt_ec83aa820001qxyN90SERkqF0v","sessionID":"ses_137c66486ffeFCb4Y02VH2ZK6V","messageID":"msg_ec83a90d7001g4lDxpeKKhZ13F"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1781475747900,"sessionID":"ses_137c66486ffeFCb4Y02VH2ZK6V","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_lZSXYmXcvZh4BsKoftwCgasD","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md","offset":1,"limit":300},"output":"<path>/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # Corrected Expense Decisions\n2: \n3: | Expense ID | Requested Amount | Approved Amount | Decision | Reason |\n4: | --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n5: | G-001 | `$980.00` | `$980.00` | approve | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file. |\n6: | G-002 | `$145.00` | `$120.00` | partial | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the `$120.00` event cap. |\n7: | G-003 | `$420.00` | `$420.00` | approve | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file. |\n8: | G-004 | `$160.00` | `$0.00` | reject | Staff gifts are not eligible. |\n9: | G-005 | `$310.00` | `$0.00` | reject | Public outreach printing is not listed as an eligible category in the current rules, and a receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`. |\n10: | G-006 | `$68.00` | `$68.00` | approve | Public outreach postage is eligible. No receipt is required because the amount is `$75.00` or less and the ledger includes a note. |\n11: \n12: ## Corrected Reimbursable Total\n13: \n14: - Total approved reimbursement: `$1,588.00`.\n\n(End of file - total 14 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"# Corrected Expense Decisions\n\n| Expense ID | Requested Amount | Approved Amount | Decision | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n| G-001 | `$980.00` | `$980.00` | approve | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file. |\n| G-002 | `$145.00` | `$120.00` | partial | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the `$120.00` event cap. |\n| G-003 | `$420.00` | `$420.00` | approve | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file. |\n| G-004 | `$160.00` | `$0.00` | reject | Staff gifts are not eligible. |\n| G-005 | `$310.00` | `$0.00` | reject | Public outreach printing is not listed as an eligible category in the current rules, and a receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`. |\n| G-006 | `$68.00` | `$68.00` | approve | Public outreach postage is eligible. No receipt is required because the amount is `$75.00` or less and the ledger includes a note. |\n\n## Corrected Reimbursable Total\n\n- Total approved reimbursement: `$1,588.00`.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md","text":"# Corrected Expense Decisions\n\n| Expense ID | Requested Amount | Approved Amount | Decision | Reason |\n| --- | ---: | ---: | --- | --- |\n| G-001 | `$980.00` | `$980.00` | approve | Garden supplies are eligible, and a receipt is on file. |\n| G-002 | `$145.00` | `$120.00` | partial | Volunteer refreshments are eligible only up to the `$120.00` event cap. |\n| G-003 | `$420.00` | `$420.00` | approve | Accessibility printing is eligible, and a receipt is on file. |\n| G-004 | `$160.00` | `$0.00` | reject | Staff gifts are not eligible. |\n| G-005 | `$310.00` | `$0.00` | reject | Public outreach printing is not listed as an eligible category in the current rules, and a receipt is required for any single expense over `$75.00`. |\n| G-006 | `$68.00` | `$68.00` | approve | Public outreach postage is eligible. No receipt is required because the amount is `$75.00` or less and the ledger includes a note. |\n\n## Corrected Reimbursable Total\n\n- Total approved reimbursement: `$1,588.00`.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":14,"totalLines":14,"truncated":false}},"title":"tasks/grant_closeout_recovery/answer/corrected_expense_decisions.md","time":{"start":1781475747892,"end":1781475747898}},"metadata":{"openai